  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Option (a) is wrong; since in adiabatic&nbsp;process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo></math> constant.</p><p>Option (b) is wrong, since in the isothermal process<br />T= constant</p><p>Option (c) &amp; (d) matches isotherms &amp; adiabatic formula :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">&#947;</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">-</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>constant</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>T</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></msup><msup><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>constant</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
